extends ../layouts/main
block content
  section.page-hero
    .container
      span.eyebrow Our impact
      h1 Help strengthen learning and opportunity
      p We welcome partners who share our commitment to quality education and teacher empowerment.
  section.py-5
    .container
      .row.g-5
        .col-lg-7
          h2 Work with us
          p Louise Junior School invites partners to contribute ideas, expertise and resources that improve learning and support teachers.
          ul.check-list
            li Advise school leadership and staff
            li Volunteer for mentoring and skills training
            li Support teacher empowerment programmes
            li Fund, purchase or partner on learning initiatives
            li Help share the school's work with others
          p.mt-4 These partnership opportunities are based on the Louise Junior School brief provided by the school.
        .col-lg-5
          .impact-card
            h3 Make a meaningful contribution
            p Contact the school to discuss current priorities, project plans and ways to support learners.
            a.btn.btn-brand(href='/contact') Contact Louise Junior School
